    <div style="margin: 2.5rem 0;">
      <img src="/assets/images/blog/home-loan-vs-rent-tax-benefits.jpg" alt="Tax benefits of a home loan in India: Section 24(b) and 80C deductions explained" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
